  "description": "newly renovated own door first floor two bedroom apartment in this quiet development of only 8 units.\nThis property is located in leafy Ballsbridge within easy access of all local amenities as well as those of Donnybrook. St Vincents Hospital, RTE & the City Centre are all close by and there are various bus routes and DART.\nThe accommodation comprises: entrance with stairs leading to living/dinning room, separate fitted kitchen, two double bedrooms and bathroom. \nAdditional features include: new bathroom, gas fired central heating and  parking for one car. Property is currently unfurnished however basic furniture package is available if required. ",
